672
00:38:00,784 --> 00:38:02,285
Bien.

673
00:38:02,827 --> 00:38:04,996
Todo el mundo, ¡reúnanse!

674
00:38:05,163 --> 00:38:07,023
Vamos, vamos, vamos.

675
